// Imp Leather Bag

@0 = ~Leather Bag~
@1 = ~Imp Leather Bag~

@10 = ~This is a small leather bag.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
@11 = ~Stitched together from the hides of several imps, this bag is surprisingly light and flexible. Despite its small size, it is elastic enough to hold a good amount of jewelry and other odds and ends.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
